{"version":1,"content":"<p>第63屆金馬獎頒獎典禮將於11月22日在台北流行音樂中心舉行，評審團陣容今日（28日）公布，由張艾嘉擔任評審團主席。</p><p>對於時隔15年後再接下評審團主席，張艾嘉活力充沛地跟影人們喊話：「金馬盛會一年一度，讓我們歡聚一堂。</p><p>」&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:21:24.499798+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:27:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.957269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.957269+00:00","content_hash":"f5236d9b44c45aa384485366d0d8dcb1028b7ed3f35e496132e976ea78062aa7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}